---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
import Timeline from '../components/Timeline.astro';
import Socials from '../components/Socials.astro';
import me from '../assets/me.jpeg';
---

<Layout
  title="About — Chandana Veeturi"
  description="A bit about Chandana Veeturi — and a timeline of how I got here."
>
  <div class="page-header about-header">
    <div class="about-photo">
      <Image src={me} alt="Chandana Veeturi" width={200} height={200} loading="eager" />
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="hero-eyebrow">About</div>
      <h1>Where I've been.</h1>
      <p>The short version of a longer story.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="about-body">
    <p>
      I'm Chandana Veeturi — a data-focused business analyst with experience spanning
      tech, financial services, and investment management technology. Over the last few
      years, I've worked at the intersection of data, operations, and product, helping
      teams transform complex business requirements into scalable data-driven solutions.
    </p>
    <p>
      I started my journey at <strong>Chegg</strong> as a Business Analyst, where I
      partnered with cross-functional teams to analyze business processes, define
      requirements, and drive operational improvements through data and automation.
      Working in a fast-paced technology environment gave me a strong foundation in
      stakeholder management, process optimization, and translating business needs
      into actionable insights.
    </p>
    <p>
      Today, I'm an <strong>Associate at Oxane Partners</strong>, working closely with
      investment management and private credit clients. My role revolves around data
      analysis, ETL processes, financial data operations, reporting automation, and
      building scalable data solutions that support decision-making across complex
      financial workflows. I collaborate with business stakeholders, product teams,
      and technology teams to streamline processes, improve data quality, and deliver
      insights that drive efficiency and business value.
    </p>
    <p>
      What excites me most is solving problems where data, technology, and business
      strategy come together. Whether it's automating workflows, designing data
      solutions, or uncovering insights from complex datasets, I enjoy building
      products and processes that create measurable impact.
    </p>

    <p style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
      The fastest way to reach me is
      <a href="mailto:chandanainfoinfo@gmail.com">email</a>. I'm also on the
      usual places:
    </p>

    <Socials variant="pills" />
  </section>

  <section style="margin-top: 3rem;">
    <h2 class="about-section-heading">Timeline</h2>
    <Timeline />
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-header {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .about-photo {
    width: 96px;
    height: 96px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 0.5px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--accent-light);
  }

  .about-photo img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 18%;
    display: block;
  }

  .about-body p {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 1.1em;
  }

  .about-body strong {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .about-body a {
    color: var(--accent);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--accent-light);
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }

  .about-body a:hover {
    border-bottom-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .about-section-heading {
    font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .about-header {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      text-align: left;
    }
    .about-photo {
      width: 80px;
      height: 80px;
    }
  }
</style>
